  m_text: "\tWelcome to ELEMENTA, a 1 vs 1 fighting game where mastering the four
    elements is the key to victory. Use fire, water, earth, and air to attack, defend,
    and adapt during every battle. Each element has unique abilities, and switching
    between them at the right moment can change the course of the fight.\n\n\tYour
    goal is to defeat your opponent by using your abilities with strategy and precision.
    Take advantage of each element\u2019s strengths and activate Master Control at
    the perfect moment to gain the upper hand.\n\n\tYou win the match by completely
    depleting your opponent\u2019s health before time runs out. If the timer ends,
    the player with the most remaining health wins."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 125cb55b44b24c4393181402bc6200e6, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 2100000, guid: 125cb55b44b24c4393181402bc6200e6, type: 2}
